"hashtags":[{"indices":[195,200],"text":"宇宙安保"},{"indices":[201,215],"text":"SDF_SpaceYear"}],"smarttags":[],"symbols":[],"urls":[{"display_url":"mod.go.jp/j/policy/agend…","expanded_url":"https://www.mod.go.jp/j/policy/agenda/meeting/space_domain/index.html","indices":[169,192],"url":"https://t.co/2I3QuGHDva"}],"user_mentions":[]},"id":"Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjIwODU2NzQ5MDM1NTA5OTIzODQ=","text":"【🛰防衛×宇宙🚀シリーズ㉖】\n第26弾は、「宇宙領域アドバイザリーボード」\n \n7月28日、防衛省は第3回宇宙領域アドバイザリーボードを開催🛰\n有識者の皆様と、防衛と経済の好循環、防衛イノベーションの促進に向けた国研・大学等との連携強化、光衛星通信の最新動向について、意見交換を行いました。\n \n👇「宇宙領域アドバイザリーボード」とは？\nhttps://t.co/2I3QuGHDva\n \n#宇宙安保\n#SDF_SpaceYear"}}},"quotedRefResult":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","rest_id":"2080230677870780422"}},"rest_id":"2085674903664279745","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"94911","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}},"rest_id":"2090739909606928743","source":"<a href=\"http://twitter.com/#!/download/ipad\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter for iPad</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"32335","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2090739909606928743","sortIndex":"2090886104730304502"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":295},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1440464873708605443/Bw8DmKFs_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/266566401/1667205513"},"core":{"created_at":"Tue Mar 15 12:52:50 +0000 2011","name":"経済産業省","screen_name":"meti_NIPPON"},